  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Programme: Integrated Innovations for Sustainable Development: Empowering Vulnerable Communities in Kaskazini Unguja and Kaskazini Pemba, Zanzibar (ZJP). The JP targets vulnerable communities living in low-lying areas of Kaskazini Unguja and Kaskazini Pemba regions (28% of the total population of Zanzibar), most of whom depend on the blue economy for their livelihoods, food, and income. Both regions experience high basic needs and food poverty rates, high food insecurities, and high school</narrative>
